  excited to see come 2019 Kristen Bell is  patiently waiting for the movie to come  out last time we checked in with Kristen  Bell she was starting to get excited  about voicing Ana's lines however months  passed before she was actually able to  start working on the project  now that frozen Sue's release date is  almost a year away Bell has some new  information for us in April of 2018  the actress appeared on The Ellen  DeGeneres Show where she confirmed that  she'd recently finished recording frozen  - the gifted actress made sure to tell  us that edits would eventually be made  but for the most part filming was  complete if there's one thing Belle  didn't hesitate to say is that she knew  how the movie would end  and which songs would undoubtedly become  bangers since keeping secrets is in her  strong suits val is as excited as we are  to see the movie come to life cell also  went on to say that her youngest  daughter isn't exactly a fan of the  franchise while she blames it on her age  some people just aren't up for building  a snowman despite having many reasons to  get excited over frozen to is released  it's still a while away so hold your  horses frozen to isn't your typical  Disney sequel when you think about it  frozen is one of the most unique Disney  movies of all there are obviously plenty  to choose from but Queen Elsa is the  only Disney character to possess mutant  my qualities shear Rapunzel has her  magical hair and Cinderella has a fairy  godmother but Elsa is the real deal  through and through and it's uncommon  for Disney movies to get a sequel  however it is common for these sequels  to go straight to DVD with this in mind  it's quite astonishing that frozen 2 is  predicted to be as successful as its  original it makes this sequel even more  special is that it's not going to follow  frozen timeline with this in mind  there's no way of knowing just what's  going to happen  Disney has stated that the direction of  frozen 2 will be 100% different and by  this they mean that a new protagonist is  going to take the stage when a sequel  makes it to the box office this usually  means that the same protagonists are  going to be used so with this in mind  frozen 2 is breaking all of the rules  but wait who's going to be the front  liner move over Anna  here comes Elsa just as we thought  frozen 2 is making way for Elsa's grand  debut despite the fact that Elsa was  present in the first frozen movie we  couldn't help a wish that we'd gotten to  know her on a more personal level well  you're in luck because Elsa is said to  be the main protagonist of the sequel  now that the ice queen has come to terms  with her powers she's bound to want to  start building her future co-director  Chris buck made it clear that the sequel  would shift its focus away from Anna and  Kristoff and on to Elsa and whoever she  ends up with despite undergoing a major  transformation in frozen Elsa still has  a long way to go truth is there's so  much about Elsa that we don't know maybe  we'll finally find out where her  mysterious powers come from now that  it's been confirmed that Elsa is taking  over this makes us wonder about Ana's  role  and influence throughout the film and  mainly whether or not Kristen Bell is  going to get a good amount of screen  time for the time being it looks like  Elsa and Anna will be bumping heads for  the number one spot so who's your  favorite sister Elsa or Anna nothing  will ever top let it go  once again our only news source is the  hilarious Kristen Bell the actress came  clean about frozen - while being  interviewed by E News she spoke about  how grateful she was to her fans for  allowing her to continue her frozen  journey as Anna she also mentioned that  there were more frozen songs out there  than Disney previously led on since only  the best songs are chosen there's a few  that got placed on the back burner which  pretty much means we'll never hear them  during the interview Bell spoke of the  sequel soundtrack with a high volume of  enthusiasm however when asked if any of  his songs with top let it go the actress  simply laughed  according to her no song will ever top  this acclaimed track there's just no way  she does however feel like frozen tube  will be jam-packed with some glorious  hits for the time being we'd love to get  our hands on the unreleased soundtrack  after all do you want to build a snowman  almost didn't make a cut which frozen  song was your favorite drop us a lyric  in the comments if you're excited for  frozen - and that's a wrap we hope  you're even more excited for frozen -  than before thanks for watching and see  you next time  [Music]
 

